        <p>Wrong item, damaged vial, or COA mismatch — full refund, no interrogation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-card">
        <div class="icon"><img src="{{ 'icon-certificate.png' | asset_url }}" alt="" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h3>3rd-Party Tested</h3>
        <p>Independent laboratory verification on all seven assays, published per batch.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
